# Null Summoner's enters ability against a hand with no nonland card: Bot2 still reveals its hand (the ability says so before
# any choice, CR 608.2c), but there is nothing Bot1 may choose (CR 608.2d), so no question is asked and nothing is exiled.
# The intervening "if you cast it" held (CR 603.4): the Summoner was cast from Bot1's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Null Summoner
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x7
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

